ads\/2020\/04\/School-Dance-Mizvah-5e9660dd7c33d-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/dt><\/dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/IMG-8332-5e9662fed2096.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/IMG-8332-5e9662fed2096-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A photo booth with a green screen and hats, perfect for capturing fun and memorable moments at your school dance.\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/IMG-8332-5e9662fed2096-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/IMG-8332-5e9662fed2096-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/dt><\/dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/photobooth-1.png'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"273\" height=\"198\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/photobooth-1.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A colorful light stand with a phone on it, offering DJ service.\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/dt><\/dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/IMG_6004-scaled.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/IMG_6004-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A man standing in front of a photo booth rental Georgia.\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/dt><\/dl><br style=\"clear: both\" \/>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\r\n<h3>Why Schools Choose JAMMIN&#8217; DJs<\/h3>\r\n<p>School administrators, staff, and student committees need more than loud music. They need a DJ company that can help keep the event organized, support the timeline, and create a fun atmosphere without making the planning process harder.<\/p>\r\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs provides DJ entertainment, MC services, decor lighting, uplighting, photo booth options, production lighting, and atmospheric effects for school events. As a result, schools can build an event package that matches the room, crowd size, budget, and desired energy level.<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Professional DJs and MCs<\/strong> who understand how to work with student crowds<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Music planning support<\/strong> for school-friendly playlists and event flow<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Sound systems<\/strong> matched to the venue and guest count<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Lighting options<\/strong> for proms, homecomings, pep rallies, and themed events<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Photo booth options<\/strong> to give students another fun activity during the event<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Production support<\/strong> for larger school dances and special events<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<h3>Clean Music, Student Requests &amp; Event Flow<\/h3>\r\n<p>Music is one of the biggest parts of any school dance. However, the playlist still needs to fit the school setting. JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can help balance popular music, student requests, clean edits, school guidelines, and the energy needed to keep the dance floor moving.<\/p>\r\n<p>Before the event, we can review important details such as event timing, announcements, special moments, theme, preferred music styles, and any songs or content your school wants to avoid. This helps the DJ guide the night with more confidence and fewer surprises.<\/p>\r\n<h3>Prom, Homecoming &amp; School Event Production<\/h3>\r\n<p>For larger events, sound and lighting matter just as much as the music. A well-planned setup can make the room feel more exciting, help students engage faster, and make the event look better in photos and videos.<\/p>\r\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can provide dance lighting, uplighting, production lighting, photo booths, and special event options depending on your school&#8217;s needs and venue rules. In addition, our team can help recommend the right setup based on the room size, layout, guest count, and event schedule.<\/p>\r\n<h3>Large Event Experience<\/h3>\r\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs has experience supporting large events, sports events, promotional events, school-style productions, and high-energy entertainment environments. That experience helps our team understand timing, crowd flow, announcements, music energy, and production details.<\/p>\r\n<p>Some of our larger events and entertainment experiences include:<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2020 Atlanta Braves Chop Fest and other Braves functions<\/li>\r\n<li>2019 Super Bowl events at the NFL Hotel, Bud Light Party at The Westin, AFC Championship Bar for the New England Patriots, and The Battery Atlanta<\/li>\r\n<li>2019 special events, post-game DJ services, and lighting for the Atlanta Braves, including Chop Fest, Super Bowl Fan Experience, watch parties, holiday parties, New Year&#8217;s Eve events, and more<\/li>\r\n<li>2019 special events DJ services for Atlanta Dragon Con at the Hilton Atlanta and Westin Atlanta<\/li>\r\n<li>2019 in-game DJ services for select professional soccer games<\/li>\r\n<li>2019-2020 lighting for Georgia Tech Basketball<\/li>\r\n<li>2018 special events DJ services for the Atlanta Braves, including New Year&#8217;s Eve, Holidays at The Battery Atlanta, and more<\/li>\r\n<li>2018 postgame DJ services for the Atlanta Braves and The Battery Atlanta on select Friday and Saturday nights<\/li>\r\n<li>2018 alternating in-game DJ services for the Atlanta Braves on select Friday and Saturday nights<\/li>\r\n<li>Events for SunTrust Park, The Battery, and the Atlanta Braves, including Billy Joel pre- and post-concert parties and post-game parties<\/li>\r\n<li>Tailgate parties and event entertainment for major sports and promotional events<\/li>\r\n<li>Rodeo All-Star events at the National Western Stock Show<\/li>\r\n<li>Cinch Fashion Shows for Western Fashion Week<\/li>\r\n<li>Bud Light VIP Game Day Tailgate Parties<\/li>\r\n<li>Bud Light Port Paradise Cruise events<\/li>\r\n<li>Triple Bypass Bicycle Race events<\/li>\r\n<li>Churchill Cup rugby events<\/li>\r\n<li>Boxing National Championships<\/li>\r\n<li>Bud Light promotional activation events<\/li>\r\n<li>NBA All-Star Game Bud Light VIP events<\/li>\r\n<li>MMA and boxing lighting and video production with the Denver Athletic Club, Sparta Combat League, and more<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<h3>See JAMMIN&#8217; DJs in Action<\/h3>\r\n<p>Want to get a better feel for the energy we bring to events? Watch the video below to see JAMMIN&#8217; DJs entertainment, lighting, and event production in action.<\/p>\r\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"JAMMIN' DJs school dance and event entertainment video\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/_Z_VgWlwoto\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe>\r\n<p>You can also find JAMMIN&#8217; DJs on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jammindjs\">Facebook<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jammindjsgeorgia\/\">Instagram<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UC2cSNHWm-ypl3DpbXYiRUaA\">YouTube<\/a>, and other social platforms by searching for JAMMIN&#8217; DJs.<\/p>\r\n<h3>Plan Your School Dance or Student Event<\/h3>\r\n<p>If you are planning a prom, homecoming, winter formal, pep rally, family fun night, tailgate party, or school celebration, JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can help with DJ entertainment, MC services, sound, lighting, photo booths, and event production support.<\/p>\r\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a School Event Quote<\/a><\/p>\r\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/jammindjs.net\/apply\/\">Want to join the JAMMIN&#8217; DJs team?<